From 99ca1ab3495e152963d3e1c5cde9d2fcdd7a9e86 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: shota <monyuonyu@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 27 Sep 2026 11:48:36 +0900
Subject: [PATCH 83/90] Unified: add a design check (DRC-like mistake finder)

Checks the whole model for failed features, invalid or split shapes,
non-solid parts, overlapping parts, sketch constraint problems, tiny
edges and floating parts. A task panel lists the problems, selects and
frames the parts, and marks the location with a red sphere. Problems
can be marked as intended per object (DesignCheckIgnore). A status bar
indicator runs the check incrementally after recomputes, and pairwise
results are cached by shape fingerprint so re-checks are fast.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
